# The generic runner (run-scenario.mjs) writes each isolated run into <scenario>/runs/<n>/ — its own
# data/.lmthing (SQLite dbs, sessions), per-step snapshots/, sessions.log, run.json, evidence
# (step-NN.json, .full.json, trace.md, summary.json), runner.pid — plus a runs/latest pointer. All
# ephemeral and often large; never committed. The committed golden copies the lib tests assert
# against live in lib/__fixtures__/, which is NOT ignored.
*/runs/
*/.run/
.run-smoke/
.runs/
